# T8 (pending): the songs list, New > Empty/Starter and the 5-slot limit.
#
# SAVE held opens SONGS (the T8i hook). New songs are written to the first free slot
# and opened; a sixth is refused with "5 SONGS MAX: DELETE ONE".
# Not run by `make scenarios` yet: see pending/README.md.
wait 300
press SAVE
wait 700
release SAVE
wait 20
expect songscreen LIST
expect songused 0
shot s01_list.png

# New > Empty in the first free slot
tap SEL
wait 20
expect songscreen NEW
shot s02_new.png
turn ALGO -1
tap SEL
wait 20
expect songscreen LIST
expect songslot 0 "NEW SONG"
expect songused 1
expect songloaded 1
shot s03_empty_created.png

# New > Starter
tap SEL
wait 20
turn ALGO 1
tap SEL
wait 20
expect songslot 1 "STARTER"
expect songused 2
shot s04_starter_created.png

# three more, then the sixth is refused
tap SEL
wait 20
tap SEL
wait 20
tap SEL
wait 20
tap SEL
wait 20
tap SEL
wait 20
expect songused 5
expect songslot 5 EMPTY
shot s05_five_max.png

tap HOME
wait 20
